<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43956" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēsămum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sīsăm-</span></b> ),
			i, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήσαμον</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Sesame</i> or <i>sesamum</i>, an oily
			plant, a native of the East, <i><span class="en">Col. 2,
				10, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 2,
				50</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 2,
			56</span></i>; 12, 15, 3; <i><span class="en">Pall. Sept. 7</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Oct. 1, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 5,
			15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 1, 2, 113</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 1 <i>fin.</i></span></i>—Collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēsĭma</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sē-săma</span></b> ,
				ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σησάμη</span>, <i><span class="en">Col. 2, 7, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 7,
				7, § 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">18, 7, 10, §
			49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">18, 10, 22,
				§ 96</span></i>, and 18, 10, 23, §
			98.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Sesamum silvestre, <i>another name for</i>
			cici, <i>the palma Christi</i>, <i>castor-oil plant</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 7, 7, §
		25</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
